@startuml
title US10 - Relevant Domain Model Excerpt\nDomain Model (DM)

left to right direction
hide methods
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

class Administrator

class TestType {
    internalCode
    nhsCode
    collectionMethodDescription
}

class TestTypeParameter

class Parameter {
    ID
    name
    description
    metric
}

Administrator "0..*" -- "0..*" TestType : manages >
TestType "1" -- "0..*" TestTypeParameter : defines >
TestTypeParameter "0..*" -- "1" Parameter : identifies >

note bottom of TestTypeParameter
Catalog entries may exist before associations
are configured. A definition used in a registered
test must identify at least one Parameter
(derived use constraint).
Association management is not implemented.
end note

@enduml
